

# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#   |      |         |
#   |      |         +-> Summary in present tense (not capitalized, no period)
#   |      |
#   |      +-> Scope:
#   |          Editor: nvim|vscode|idea
#   |          Terminal: tmux|alacritty|kitty|wezterm
#   |          Shell: zsh|bash|fish
#   |          VCS: git|github|gitlab
#   |          Others: other
#   |
#   +-> Type: feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|conf|test|chore
#
# [optional body]
# - why was this change necessary?
# - what side effects does this change have?
# - more detailed description of the change
#
# [optional footer]
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
# Closes|Fixes|Resolves #<issue number>
# Co-authored-by: name <email>
#
# Examples:
# feat(nvim): add telescope fuzzy finder
# fix(tmux): resolve session restore issue
# conf(zsh): update plugin configuration
#
# Full example with body and footer:
# feat(nvim): add new LSP configuration
#
# - added native LSP support for C/C++
# - configured clangd as the default LSP server
# - improved diagnostic display
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: requires Neovim 0.8+
# Closes #123
